{{Further|Blox Fruits}}
'''Beast''' is one of the three main classifications of [[Blox Fruits]], alongside [[Natural]] and [[Elemental]]. Beast fruits allow the user to [[Transformation|transform]] into powerful animals, mythological creatures, or divine beings, granting abilities that reflect the nature of the form they take. These fruits are often defined by their transformative power, enhanced mobility, and overwhelming presence in combat. Beast fruits are often one of the best fruits for travelling. There are currently 9 Beast fruits and 3 Beast [[mutations]] in the game.

